@ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228

GET {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###


### 1. Obtener todos los libros
GET {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Books
Accept: application/json

### 2. Obtener libro por ID
GET {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Books/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Crear nuevo libro
POST {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture in .NET",
  "description": "Una guía completa sobre Clean Architecture y patrones de software.",
  "pageCount": 350,
  "excerpt": "Aislando el dominio de la infraestructura.",
  "publishDate": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 4. Actualizar libro existente
PUT {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture in .NET - 2nd Edition",
  "description": "Edición actualizada y revisada.",
  "pageCount": 400,
  "excerpt": "Nuevos patrones y mejores prácticas.",
  "publishDate": "2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 5. Eliminar libro
DELETE {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Books/1


### ================= AUTHORS =================

### 6. Obtener todos los autores
GET {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Authors
Accept: application/json

### 7. Obtener autor por ID
GET {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Authors/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Crear nuevo autor
POST {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idBook": 1,
  "firstName": "Raydelto",
  "lastName": "Hernandez"
}

### 9. Actualizar autor existente
PUT {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Authors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idBook": 1,
  "firstName": "Uncle",
  "lastName": "Bob"
}

### 10. Eliminar autor
DELETE {{ClaroTestBackend.API_HostAddress}}/api/Authors/1